    "risk": "exploratory",
    "status": "DECLARED",
    "text": "UPDATE 2026-10-12 (verified live, no change needed): LXC 104 HAS features: nesting=1; the 3 deployed S5 services (algedonic/covenant/ledger) run ProtectSystem=full with ZERO mount-namespace errors over 20d uptime (since Sep 22) -- the CRITICAL LATENT RISK did not materialize (flag was set; 104 was never actually missing it, or it was fixed without record).",
