    "text": "note: \"The reconnect leg reuses ratified DEBOUNCE_BASELINE=3 (P1) — coupled numbers move together.",
    "text_hash": "4bda906aa74b759f2c408c3f8d21c7a479e226f765509e3082a66a16311bc99a",
    "provenance": "claim_ingest deterministic:num_eq",
    "method": "deterministic",
    "section": "body",
    "source_id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2",
    "checkable": "machine",
    "falsifier": true,
    "certs": [],
    "value": "3",
    "quantity": "debouncebaseline",
    "op": "="
  },
  {
    "id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2-C055",
    "type": "number",
    "subject": "docs/reference/parameter_registry.vsm",
    "risk": "exploratory",
    "status": "DECLARED",
    "text": "note: \"Paired copy in checks/algedonic-queue-consumed (48h = 24h window + 24h grace).",
    "text_hash": "8605c4acd74360bcf220acad66924ce04b6af98ab92a112779b01f6e34911c87",
    "provenance": "claim_ingest deterministic:num_eq",
    "method": "deterministic",
    "section": "body",
    "source_id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2",
    "checkable": "machine",
    "falsifier": true,
    "certs": [],
    "value": "24",
    "quantity": "h",
    "op": "="
  },
  {
    "id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2-C056",
    "type": "theorem",
    "subject": "docs/reference/parameter_registry.vsm",
    "risk": "exploratory",
    "status": "DECLARED",
    "text": "The two must move together: raise the ack without the check bound and stale pain becomes invisible to the gate; lower the check below the ack and it goes red on healthy queue.",
    "text_hash": "804c276235dfafe84a54efd2a5ab6e92fa0de0bf966d2c4c3983dc914d1a8828",
    "provenance": "claim_ingest deterministic:quantifier",
    "method": "deterministic",
    "section": "body",
    "source_id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2",
    "checkable": "machine",
    "falsifier": false,
    "certs": []
  },
  {
    "id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2-C057",
    "type": "number",
    "subject": "docs/reference/parameter_registry.vsm",
    "risk": "exploratory",
    "status": "DECLARED",
    "text": "{ param: \"Learn-pipeline idle throttle (IDLE_MIN_INTERVAL_MS = 5min)\",",
    "text_hash": "0dcf39c66c3d5bd6598670ca2cb8c50b6967ca9c9e148d69c94c990751eac240",
    "provenance": "claim_ingest deterministic:num_eq",
    "method": "deterministic",
    "section": "body",
    "source_id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2",
    "checkable": "machine",
    "falsifier": true,
    "certs": [],
    "value": "5",
    "quantity": "idleminintervalms",
    "op": "="
  },
  {
    "id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2-C058",
    "type": "number",
    "subject": "docs/reference/parameter_registry.vsm",
    "risk": "exploratory",
    "status": "DECLARED",
    "text": "note: \"The LIVE bounds are hand-coded in checks/attestations-retention (AGE_MAX_D=16 = 7d window + weekly grace; COUNT_MAX=17000 ~14d margin) and the 7d window itself was an S5 decision (D-14).",
    "text_hash": "fe5ed6e8c68c993689d0a766b0e653e63b6d4f585107c56008985845f897aa6a",
    "provenance": "claim_ingest deterministic:num_eq",
    "method": "deterministic",
    "section": "body",
    "source_id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2",
    "checkable": "machine",
    "falsifier": true,
    "certs": [],
    "value": "16",
    "quantity": "agemaxd",
    "op": "="
  },
  {
    "id": "SRC-PARAMETER-REGISTRY-6f54c9c2-C059",
    "type": "number",
    "subject": "docs/reference/parameter_registry.vsm",
    "risk": "exploratory",
    "status": "DECLARED",
    "text": "note: \"The LIVE bounds are hand-coded in checks/attestations-retention (AGE_MAX_D=16 = 7d window + weekly grace; COUNT_MAX=17000 ~14d margin) and the 7d window itself was an S5 decision (D-14).",
    "text_hash": "fe5ed6e8c68c993689d0a766b0e653e63b6d4f585107c56008985845f897aa6a",
    "provenance": "claim_ingest deterministic:num_eq",
    "method": "deterministic",
