    "type": "theorem",
    "subject": "docs/reference/parameter_registry.vsm",
    "risk": "exploratory",
    "status": "DECLARED",
    "text": "Same pattern as the visibility-window row: future amends must touch plan + check in one commit or the gate starts certifying a criterion nobody wrote.\" },",
